WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back and cross one ankle over the opposite thigh.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Keep the head and shoulders heavy.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Option: draw the base thigh in gently.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the outer hip.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
